{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/ClickButtons.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Boba Teashop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you own and manage a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare boba teas, serve customers, and expand your menu to attract more patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_ManageABobaShop.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/RisaFace-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Risa, a woman in her 30s who is tired of corporate life and has decided to chase her dream of opening a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_ServeCustomers.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/Customerwalksin-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a boba tea shop owner, you will encounter a variety of customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to greet them with a smile and take their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_MakeDeliciousBoba.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/MakingDrinks-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Making boba tea is simple.\u00a0The ingredients are just milk tea and boba.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seal the cup with a lid and serve it with a straw for sipping and enjoying the boba pearls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TroublesomeCustomers_2_Optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But sometimes, you'll encounter demanding customers with special requests or those who leave a mess in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the proud owner of a boba tea shop, there's nothing you can't handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_Terror-effect2.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/Hurry_2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While serving customers and managing your boba tea shop, you start seeing visions and hearing things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it all in your head, or is something haunting the place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is\u00a0psychological horror game that builds tension through eerie atmosphere, unsettling events, and moments of intense scare when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> A simple yet engaging loop where you take orders from customers, prepare their drinks, and serve them with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS Aesthetics:</strong> Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong> Uncover Risa's journey and personal growth as she pursues her dream of becoming a successful boba tea shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For content creators:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boba is love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/b0b9a9dba9714058cfe7c38e8b15ab8c79b80f46.jpg"},{"name":"Spotless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/2fcd9a2a13950c1c52b5a07b1ea18a89e2ecd218.jpg"},{"name":"Brewing Profits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/b9b11a3137f52ee5f69f9152fe192534350c897d.jpg"},{"name":"Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/6f0293e873af9e90132c2476c5d7228a99a935fb.jpg"},{"name":"All That Glitters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/c8c46037e959a78bc7acf8831dbdeb1c234b9210.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461920?t=1745490033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/6a79d6c2d2b20bf10c0ad0476045c22ef40bc1cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745490033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/a3fc834a74555893082464e092db52d6802eab76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745490033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/a3fc834a74555893082464e092db52d6802eab76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745490033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all audiences. It includes:\r\n-Depictions of suicide\r\n-Stylized representations of blood and unsettling scenes\r\n\r\nSome story elements explore psychological distress and mental health struggles that may be disturbing to sensitive players."},"demos":[{"appid":3521210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/ClickButtons.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Boba Teashop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you own and manage a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare boba teas, serve customers, and expand your menu to attract more patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_ManageABobaShop.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/RisaFace-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Risa, a woman in her 30s who is tired of corporate life and has decided to chase her dream of opening a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_ServeCustomers.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/Customerwalksin-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a boba tea shop owner, you will encounter a variety of customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to greet them with a smile and take their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_MakeDeliciousBoba.png?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/MakingDrinks-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Making boba tea is simple.\u00a0The ingredients are just milk tea and boba.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seal the cup with a lid and serve it with a straw for sipping and enjoying the boba pearls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TroublesomeCustomers_2_Optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But sometimes, you'll encounter demanding customers with special requests or those who leave a mess in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the proud owner of a boba tea shop, there's nothing you can't handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/TBT_Divider_Terror-effect2.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/Hurry_2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745490033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While serving customers and managing your boba tea shop, you start seeing visions and hearing things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it all in your head, or is something haunting the place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is\u00a0psychological horror game that builds tension through eerie atmosphere, unsettling events, and moments of intense scare when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> A simple yet engaging loop where you take orders from customers, prepare their drinks, and serve them with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS Aesthetics:</strong> Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong> Uncover Risa's journey and personal growth as she pursues her dream of becoming a successful boba tea shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For content creators:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Mike Ten"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/header.jpg?t=1745490033","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127710/movie480.mp4?t=17449794